00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:35.735
I've actually never had Cherry Garcia.

00:10:38.804 --> 00:10:40.740
Into the palate.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.441
Ooh, that's a 10 right there, baby.

00:10:42.441 --> 00:10:43.709
Similarly to the topped tubs,

00:10:43.709 --> 00:10:45.745
we also used to be able to
get mini tubs in the UK,

00:10:45.745 --> 00:10:47.713
