This one I mentioned earlier, Half Baked,

00:11:26.686 --> 00:11:27.920
6 ounces for some reason.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:28.754
All the other ones are 8.

00:11:28.754 --> 00:11:29.789
I don't know why they did that.

00:11:29.789 --> 00:11:32.358
The Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough

00:11:32.358 --> 00:11:35.094
and Peanut Butter Chocolate
Chip Cookie Dough.

00:11:35.094 --> 00:11:37.296
You can also get The Tonight Dough,

00:11:37.296 --> 00:11:38.764
[Cinnamon Bun] Dough,

00:11:38.764 --> 00:11:40.266
Gingerbread Cookie Dough,

00:11:40.266 --> 00:11:42.568
and a vegan Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough.

00:11:42.568 --> 00:11:45.871
One US-exclusive Ben Jerry's item that,

00:11:45.871 --> 00:11:47.707
people, I assure you,

00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:50.943
I tried, I tried, I tried
to get my hands on it

00:11:50.943 --> 00:11:52.111
in time for the shooting.

00:11:52.111 --> 00:11:53.212
Just couldn't happen.

00:11:53.212 --> 00:11:57.116
Ben &amp; Jerry also has two
